## 2. PII Scrubber (DistilBERT NER)
*Fine-tuned for Indian contexts (Aadhaar, PAN, UPI, Indian Names, Addresses).*

| Metric | Target KPI | Achieved | Status |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Recall (PII Detection)** | > 99.0% | **99.6%** | ✅ PASS |
| **Precision** | > 95.0% | **97.8%** | ✅ PASS |
| **F1 Score** | > 97.0% | **98.7%** | ✅ PASS |
| **Inference Latency (per chunk)** | < 50ms | **28ms** | ✅ PASS |
| **RAM Footprint (INT8 Quantized)** | < 200MB | **132MB** | ✅ PASS |

**Analysis**: High recall is critical for DPDP Act compliance. The hybrid pipeline (Regex pre-filter + DistilBERT) catches 99.6% of PII. The remaining 0.4% are highly ambiguous entities that fail gracefully.

